# ⌨️ TypeForge Platform — Implementation Plan

## 📋 Overview

**Project**: AI-Powered Typing Speed Test Platform (Monkeytype-inspired)  
**Repository**: `vdtheone/typeforge-platform`  
**Backend Stack**: Django 5.2 + Django REST Framework + PostgreSQL + Redis + Celery  
**Current State**: Greenfield — empty repository  
**Target**: Phase 1 MVP (4–6 weeks)

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Client Layer"
        A[React/Next.js Frontend]
    end

    subgraph "API Gateway"
        B[Nginx Reverse Proxy]
    end

    subgraph "Application Layer"
        C[Django REST Framework API]
        D[Django Channels WebSocket]
        E[Celery Workers]
    end

    subgraph "Data Layer"
        F[(PostgreSQL)]
        G[(Redis Cache)]
        H[RabbitMQ/Redis Broker]
    end

    A --> B
    B --> C
    B --> D
    C --> F
    C --> G
    D --> G
    E --> F
    E --> H
    C --> H
```

---

