## 🗓️ Milestones

### Milestone 1 — Project Foundation & Core Models
**Duration**: 3–4 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 1.1 | Django project scaffolding | Split settings, custom User model, `.env` config |
| 1.2 | Core app setup | `TimeStampedModel`, pagination, throttling, exception handler |
| 1.3 | Accounts app — models | Custom `User` model with `AbstractUser`, `UserProfile` model |
| 1.4 | WordLists app — models | `WordList`, `Language` models with seed data |
| 1.5 | Themes app — models | `Theme` model with CSS variable JSON |
| 1.6 | Results app — models | `Result` model with keystroke JSON, WPM, accuracy fields |
| 1.7 | Analytics app — models | `AnalyticsSnapshot`, `TypingSession` models |
| 1.8 | Leaderboards app — models | `LeaderboardEntry` model |
| 1.9 | Database migrations | Generate and apply all initial migrations |
| 1.10 | Docker setup | `docker-compose.yml` with Django, PostgreSQL, Redis |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The custom `User` model **must** be created before the first migration. Changing it later is extremely painful in Django.

---

### Milestone 2 — Authentication System
**Duration**: 2–3 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 2.1 | JWT Authentication | `djangorestframework-simplejwt` setup |
| 2.2 | Registration endpoint | `POST /api/v1/auth/register/` with email verification |
| 2.3 | Login endpoint | `POST /api/v1/auth/login/` — returns JWT pair |
| 2.4 | Token refresh | `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh/` |
| 2.5 | Password management | Reset, change, forgot password flows |
| 2.6 | User profile CRUD | `GET/PATCH /api/v1/users/me/` |
| 2.7 | Google OAuth | `dj-rest-auth` + `django-allauth` social login |
| 2.8 | GitHub OAuth | Social login provider |
| 2.9 | Guest mode | Anonymous typing with optional account linking |

---

### Milestone 3 — Typing Test Engine APIs
**Duration**: 3–4 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 3.1 | Test generation endpoint | `GET /api/v1/tests/generate/` — returns word array |
| 3.2 | Mode handling | Time, word count, quote, custom, code modes |
| 3.3 | Word list selection | Filter by language, difficulty, word count |
| 3.4 | Quote integration | Curated quotes with attribution |
| 3.5 | Custom word list upload | User-created word lists (public/private) |
| 3.6 | Test submission | `POST /api/v1/tests/submit/` — validates & stores result |
| 3.7 | Anti-cheat validation | WPM ceiling, keystroke timing analysis, consistency checks |
| 3.8 | WPM calculation service | Net WPM, Raw WPM, accuracy, consistency formulas |

> [!TIP]
> The anti-cheat system should run **synchronously** on submission for basic checks, with deeper analysis offloaded to Celery.

---

### Milestone 4 — Results & History
**Duration**: 2 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 4.1 | Results list endpoint | `GET /api/v1/results/` — paginated, filterable |
| 4.2 | Result detail endpoint | `GET /api/v1/results/:id/` — full keystroke replay data |
| 4.3 | Result filters | By mode, language, date range, WPM range |
| 4.4 | Personal best tracking | Track PBs per mode/duration/language combo |
| 4.5 | Result statistics | Aggregated stats (avg WPM, best WPM, total tests) |
| 4.6 | Replay data API | Serve keystroke-by-keystroke replay data |

---

### Milestone 5 — Themes & Customization
**Duration**: 1–2 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 5.1 | Built-in themes API | `GET /api/v1/themes/` — list all themes |
| 5.2 | Theme detail API | `GET /api/v1/themes/:id/` — full CSS variable set |
| 5.3 | Custom theme creation | `POST /api/v1/themes/` — user-created themes |
| 5.4 | Theme sharing | Public themes, like/favorite system |
| 5.5 | User preferences | Store active theme, font, caret style preferences |
| 5.6 | Seed built-in themes | 15+ curated themes (dark, light, colorful, minimal) |

---

### Milestone 6 — Basic Analytics & Leaderboards
**Duration**: 3–4 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 6.1 | Analytics dashboard API | `GET /api/v1/analytics/dashboard/` — user summary |
| 6.2 | WPM trend API | Time-series WPM data for charts |
| 6.3 | Accuracy trend API | Time-series accuracy data |
| 6.4 | Weak key detection | Basic frequency analysis of error keys |
| 6.5 | Analytics snapshot worker | Celery task: daily/weekly aggregation |
| 6.6 | Global leaderboard | `GET /api/v1/leaderboards/global/` — Redis sorted sets |
| 6.7 | Daily leaderboard | Auto-reset daily rankings |
| 6.8 | Leaderboard filters | By mode, duration, language |

---

### Milestone 7 — Polish, Testing & Deployment
**Duration**: 3–4 days

| # | Task | Details |
|---|------|---------|
| 7.1 | API documentation | DRF Spectacular / Swagger auto-docs |
| 7.2 | Rate limiting | Per-endpoint throttling |
| 7.3 | CORS configuration | Proper frontend origin allowlisting |
| 7.4 | Unit tests | Model, serializer, view tests |
| 7.5 | Integration tests | Full API flow tests |
| 7.6 | Docker production config | Multi-stage build, Gunicorn, Nginx |
| 7.7 | CI/CD pipeline | GitHub Actions for lint, test, deploy |
| 7.8 | Seed data scripts | Word lists, themes, demo users |
| 7.9 | README & API docs | Complete project documentation |

