## 🔐 API Endpoints Summary (Phase 1)

### Authentication
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/register/` | Register new user |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/login/` | Login, get JWT |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/refresh/` | Refresh access token |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/logout/` | Blacklist refresh token |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/password/reset/` | Request password reset |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/password/change/` | Change password |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/auth/google/` | Google OAuth redirect |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/auth/github/` | GitHub OAuth redirect |

### Users
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/users/me/` | Get current user profile |
| `PATCH` | `/api/v1/users/me/` | Update profile |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/users/:username/` | Public profile |
| `PATCH` | `/api/v1/users/me/preferences/` | Update preferences |

### Typing Tests
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/tests/generate/` | Generate test words |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/tests/submit/` | Submit test result |

### Results
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/results/` | List user results |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/results/:id/` | Result detail |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/results/stats/` | Aggregated stats |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/results/personal-bests/` | Personal bests |

### Word Lists
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/wordlists/` | List word lists |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/wordlists/:id/` | Word list detail |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/wordlists/` | Create custom list |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/wordlists/languages/` | Available languages |

### Themes
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/themes/` | List themes |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/themes/:id/` | Theme detail |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/themes/` | Create theme |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/themes/:id/like/` | Like a theme |

### Analytics
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/analytics/dashboard/` | Dashboard summary |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/analytics/wpm-trend/` | WPM over time |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/analytics/accuracy-trend/` | Accuracy over time |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/analytics/weak-keys/` | Weak key analysis |

### Leaderboards
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/leaderboards/global/` | Global leaderboard |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/leaderboards/daily/` | Daily leaderboard |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/leaderboards/weekly/` | Weekly leaderboard |

